    "location": "he well-established residential area of Mount Merrion is ideally situated close to Dublin City Centre, with excellent transport links ensuring easy access to every part of Dublin. Located just off the N11 Stillorgan Road, Oatlands Manor connects seamlessly to the M11, M50, and City Centre. A Quality Bus Corridor runs by the development, providing fast and frequent travel to the City Centre, while the DART (Blackrock Station, 3.6km) and Luas Green Line (Stillorgan, 1.6km) are just minutes away."
